<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10690" root="خشف" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَشُوفٌ</span></b>  A <i>quick,</i> or <i>swift,</i> man. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  One
<i>going away,</i> or <i>who goes away, into the land,</i> or
<i>country;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَشِيفٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاشِفٌ</span></b> . (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
One <i>entering,</i> or <i>who enters,</i> into a thing; as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَشِيفٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاشِفٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخشَفٌ</span></b> . (K.) One
<i>who enters into affairs</i> (K, TA) <i>and fears not,</i>
or <i>dreads not;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْشَفٌ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  Also
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاشِفٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاشِفَةٌ</span></b>  sings. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُشَّفٌ</span>, which
signifies Camels <i>that journey by night:</i> (S:) or,
accord. to IB, the sing. of this pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاشِفٌ</span> only:
and the pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُشُوفٌ</span> is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُشَّفٌ</span> [a mistranscription
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُشُفٌ</span>]. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْشَفٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  and the
paragraph here next following.

